.TH SDXI_TYPES 3
.SH NAME
sdxi_types \- base libsdxi types, version macros, and handle declarations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <sdxi/types.h>
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR sdxi/types.h
contains declarations shared by the rest of the installed libsdxi header set.
.PP
It provides:
.TP
.B SDXI_VERSION_MAJOR, SDXI_VERSION_MINOR, SDXI_VERSION_PATCH, SDXI_VERSION_STRING
public library version macros
.TP
.B sdxi_root_t
opaque local inventory type for device discovery
.TP
.B sdxi_dev_t
opaque device handle type
.TP
.B sdxi_cxt_t
opaque context handle type
.TP
.B struct sdxi_admin_cpl
common completion-status POD used by admin helper APIs
.SH RETURN VALUE CONVENTION
Unless documented otherwise, libsdxi functions return 0 on success and
\-errno on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDXI (7),
.BR sdxi_root (3),
.BR sdxi_util (3),
.BR sdxi_dev (3),
.BR sdxi_cxt (3)
